Then I'll stay and help.

276
00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:29,760
No need.

277
00:22:30,520 --> 00:22:31,760
Inspector.

278
00:22:31,840 --> 00:22:34,000
I care about the village kids too.

279
00:22:34,840 --> 00:22:37,120
It's fine.
I've been watching for a while already.

280
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,440
I was about to head home.

281
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:40,800
Let them enjoy their party.

282
00:22:41,480 --> 00:22:42,680
I'll be leaving soon anyway.

283
00:22:43,520 --> 00:22:44,520
Alright, then.

284
00:22:44,720 --> 00:22:45,720
I'll be going.

285
00:23:04,280 --> 00:23:05,640
Umm…

286
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:08,200
I was thinking…
maybe

287
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:10,920
we should station officers

288
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:15,200
around the forest
and all the way to the rocky outcrop.

289
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:18,520
You think the killer will come back?

290
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:20,080
It's possible.

291
00:23:20,360 --> 00:23:21,400
Every victim was killed in the forest.

292
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:22,960
Maybe

293
00:23:23,040 --> 00:23:24,640
the killer

294
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:26,320
left something behind

295
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:28,720
footprints,
blood,

296
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:29,960
clothing, evidence.

297
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:31,640
If outsiders keep coming through the area,

298
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:33,120
the evidence could get contaminated.

299
00:23:34,320 --> 00:23:36,760
When you actually focus on your job,
you're pretty sharp.

300
00:23:38,600 --> 00:23:39,600
Take care of it.

301
00:23:40,120 --> 00:23:41,240
Yes, ma'am.

302
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,480
Uh, Lieutenant…

303
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:47,880
do you still want me
to keep an eye on the inspector?

304
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:50,760
Mm.

305
00:23:50,840 --> 00:23:51,840
Understood.

306
00:23:59,040 --> 00:24:00,080
Alright, everyone.

307
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:01,280
Make sure any evidence gets to me
as soon as possible.

308
00:24:01,360 --> 00:24:03,400
-Yes, sir.
-Thank you!

309
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:02,480
Ton.

310
00:26:23,320 --> 00:26:25,160
Mr. Sumet!
Mr. Sumet!

311
00:26:25,240 --> 00:26:26,600
Mr. Sumet!
Mr. Sumet!

312
00:26:26,680 --> 00:26:28,080
Mr. Sumet!
Mr. Sumet!

313
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:29,560
Mr. Sumet!
Mr. Sumet!

314
00:26:29,640 --> 00:26:30,960
Mr. Sumet!
Mr. Sumet!

315
00:26:31,040 --> 00:26:32,040
Mr. Sumet!

316
00:26:46,680 --> 00:26:48,120
The roads were completely ruined

317
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:50,000
because of

318
00:26:50,080 --> 00:26:51,360
overloaded trucks.

319
00:26:51,800 --> 00:26:52,800
Looks like

320
00:26:53,760 --> 00:26:56,240
the villagers really like your opponent.

321
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:00,680
Take care of him.

322
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:06,560
You order me around like I'm your dog.

323
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,400
If I win this election,

324
00:27:11,320 --> 00:27:13,680
everything will be mine. Completely.

325
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:16,440
What do you want?

326
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:21,120
They spent more than 10 years studying.

327
00:27:23,040 --> 00:27:24,560
Now that's more like it.

328
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:37,240
And then there's the problem
of illegal loan sharks.

329
00:27:38,760 --> 00:27:40,680
We all know the real intention

330
00:27:42,560 --> 00:27:45,600
of those lenders.
They want slaves. Debt slaves.

331
00:27:46,360 --> 00:27:47,680
People trapped for life,

332
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,880
with no chance of ever rising again.

333
00:27:51,720 --> 00:27:53,480
We've always known this.

334
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:00,720
Deliver the package.

335
00:28:24,760 --> 00:28:25,760
Come on, eat something Ton.

336
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:32,640
It's your favorite, isn't it?

337
00:28:58,800 --> 00:28:59,920
Is something wrong?

338
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:10,040
Do you want to talk about it?

339
00:29:35,520 --> 00:29:36,520
Mr. Chawin,

340
00:29:36,800 --> 00:29:39,280
I'd like to entrust my son to you.

341
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:42,640
Maybe you could give him
some work at your farm.

342
00:29:44,800 --> 00:29:45,880
Yes,

343
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:47,920
perhaps it'll help him have
a better future.

344
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:55,120
Mm. Alright. I'll take care of him.

345
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:00,800
Thank you very much.

346
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:01,880
Thank you very much.

347
00:30:03,560 --> 00:30:04,920
Thank you so much, Mr. Chawin!

348
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:06,920
Thank you so much!

349
00:30:09,160 --> 00:30:10,160
Shut up!

350
00:30:18,320 --> 00:30:19,640
Shut up! Don't cry!

351
00:30:27,320 --> 00:30:29,520
I can't take this anymore.

352
00:30:33,720 --> 00:30:36,120
Having to see my own husband
doing it with a boy

353
00:30:36,800 --> 00:30:37,920
on my bed.

354
00:30:39,600 --> 00:30:40,600
You sick freaks.

355
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:42,200
I hope all of you rot in hell.

356
00:31:09,040 --> 00:31:10,240
Package delivery!

357
00:31:11,320 --> 00:31:12,320
Yes?

358
00:31:14,520 --> 00:31:15,520
What is it?

359
00:31:15,840 --> 00:31:17,040
I have a package for you.

360
00:31:17,840 --> 00:31:18,840
Huh?

361
00:31:19,080 --> 00:31:20,640
From whom? I didn't order anything.

362
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,640
Are you Mr. Sumet?

363
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:23,880
Yes, that's me.

364
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:26,120
-Here you go, sir.
-Thank you.

365
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:27,520
Could you please sign for it?

366
00:31:28,040 --> 00:31:29,040
Who sent this?

367
00:32:03,120 --> 00:32:04,160
Shouldn't we talk somewhere else?

368
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:08,720
He's deaf and mute.

369
00:32:08,800 --> 00:32:09,840
He doesn't know anything.

370
00:32:28,960 --> 00:32:31,000
I've already taken care of that teacher.

371
00:32:31,560 --> 00:32:32,640
As for the killer,

372
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:34,920
I think I'll pin it on Nai
and make him the fall guy.

373
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,240
We'll frame him for it.

374
00:32:39,040 --> 00:32:41,080
The fight he had with Teacher Sumet.

375
00:32:41,160 --> 00:32:43,440
Selling marijuana to the village teens.

376
00:32:45,560 --> 00:32:46,720
I'll manufacture the witnesses myself.

377
00:32:47,400 --> 00:32:48,400
Case closed. End of story.

378
00:33:16,560 --> 00:33:17,760
The garage is closed today.

379
00:33:18,600 --> 00:33:19,760
I'm not here to get my car fixed.

380
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:28,720
I'm Chee's cousin.

381
00:33:29,760 --> 00:33:31,000
I've seen you around a lot before.

382
00:33:35,400 --> 00:33:36,400
I know who you are.

383
00:33:39,240 --> 00:33:40,760
Inspector Tang and Uncle Chawin

384
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:43,520
are working together
to throw you in prison.

385
00:33:46,120 --> 00:33:47,120
What did you say?

386
00:33:50,320 --> 00:33:51,800
They're going to make you the fall guy
for Teacher Sumet's murder.

387
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:53,000
And maybe

388
00:33:53,080 --> 00:33:54,480
the other deaths too.

389
00:34:01,360 --> 00:34:03,240
You're Chawin's nephew.
Why are you telling me this?

390
00:34:05,600 --> 00:34:06,920
Believe me or don't.

391
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:12,760
I know all about how you got framed before

392
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:14,880
and ended up in prison.

393
00:34:19,400 --> 00:34:20,400
Listen.

394
00:34:21,160 --> 00:34:22,280
The reason I'm telling you this is

395
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:24,640
because I want something in return.

396
00:34:27,160 --> 00:34:28,480
Get rid of Chawin for me.

397
00:34:29,440 --> 00:34:30,440
If Chawin dies,

398
00:34:31,160 --> 00:34:32,160
I inherit everything.

399
00:34:33,800 --> 00:34:34,800
And you'll get it too.

400
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:41,400
What?

401
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:46,320
I'm sick of waiting.

402
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:51,280
When the hell is he finally going to die?

403
00:34:59,120 --> 00:35:00,120
I get the inheritance.

404
00:35:00,560 --> 00:35:01,560
You get your freedom.

405
00:35:02,960 --> 00:35:04,920
And I'll give you
a huge cut of the money too.

406
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:06,960
Interested?

407
00:35:09,960 --> 00:35:10,960
Hold on.

408
00:35:12,080 --> 00:35:14,800
So you're asking me to find a way
to get Chawin killed?

409
00:35:17,440 --> 00:35:18,720
And what about Inspector Tang?

410
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:21,480
There's no way he'd just let us
walk away afterward.

411
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:24,040
Don't look at it like that.

412
00:35:25,400 --> 00:35:28,800
Consider this payment for warning you
that Inspector Tang

413
00:35:29,080 --> 00:35:30,840
is planning to put you behind bars.

414
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:35,720
As for Inspector Tang,
don't worry about him.

415
00:35:36,560 --> 00:35:37,680
A guy like that?

416
00:35:38,280 --> 00:35:39,360
Throw enough money at him
and he'll be satisfied.

417
00:35:40,240 --> 00:35:41,240
You know that.

418
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:49,960
Think about it.

419
00:35:50,680 --> 00:35:51,680
But don't take too long.

420
00:35:52,560 --> 00:35:54,080
Inspector Tang probably
won't wait forever.

421
00:35:57,920 --> 00:35:58,960
Wait.

422
00:36:08,840 --> 00:36:10,160
What if I get the poison for you…

423
00:36:11,440 --> 00:36:12,760
and you handle the rest yourself?

424
00:36:36,240 --> 00:36:38,400
A few years in prison won't kill you.

425
00:36:38,800 --> 00:36:42,320
I didn't do it.
Chee was the one who did it!

426
00:36:54,600 --> 00:36:55,640
Just take the fall.

427
00:36:59,560 --> 00:37:02,280
The sooner you take the fall,
the less you'll get hurt.

428
00:37:03,120 --> 00:37:05,000
Let me go!

429
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:17,880
Look,

430
00:37:18,600 --> 00:37:19,920
you'll only do a few years.

431
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:21,920
When you get out,
you'll have enough money to start over.

432
00:37:22,520 --> 00:37:23,520
Trust me.

433
00:37:34,600 --> 00:37:40,120
There. Thanks.

434
00:38:08,760 --> 00:38:09,960
Smile.

435
00:38:46,600 --> 00:38:47,680
Let's run away.

436
00:38:52,680 --> 00:38:53,720
Run away where?

437
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:55,880
I don't know.

438
00:38:56,640 --> 00:38:57,640
Anywhere.

439
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:02,400
Don't you want the money?

440
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:04,280
Look, Pin's already escaped.

441
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:06,840
And we don't even know
if Tang is really coming after us or not.

442
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:08,400
Let's just leave
this stupid village behind.

443
00:39:11,280 --> 00:39:12,360
You're such a coward.

444
00:39:13,480 --> 00:39:14,480
What the hell?

445
00:39:15,200 --> 00:39:16,920
Is that money really that important?

446
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:18,360
It's 10 million baht!

447
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:20,800
Do you think you'll ever make
that much money in your lifetime?

448
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,920
If not, then shut your mouth.

449
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:24,920
God, you're wasting my time.

450
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:27,360
Fine, then spend the rest of your life
selling weed and fixing cars.

451
00:39:30,920 --> 00:39:32,080
Jeans!

452
00:40:17,040 --> 00:40:18,160
Shit!

453
00:40:20,160 --> 00:40:21,400
Shit!
